<!--
  T043 Waterside fixture, near Box Hill (the features are invented; only the place is real). Four
  footpaths each about 280 m long, running east, and water just north of them, its near edge about
  11 m away: a canal along all of path 100; nothing near path 101; a sewage works' tanks along all
  of path 102; a river along the western half of path 103. osm2pgsql needs all nodes before all
  ways, each sorted by ID. 0.001° of latitude here is about 111 m; 0.001° of longitude about 70 m.
-->
